# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Pitch page (0.3.1): drone I's wave over drone II's on one
# time line, cycle ticks, the interval with its arrow first; a few cents' detune sliding; Reso and a filter key as
# the river bed under the wave. No expectations (main's build plays this script too).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tap PLAY
wav pitch-page.wav
wait 2500
page 1
wait 1500
shot pitch-5th.png
press SEL
spin K3 4
release SEL
wait 1500
shot pitch-detune-a.png
wait 1000
shot pitch-detune-b.png
spin K3 -7
wait 2500
shot pitch-unison.png
spin K3 12
wait 2500
shot pitch-octave.png
spin K4 30
wait 300
shot pitch-reso.png
tapkey b2
wait 400
shot pitch-filter-key.png
wait 2500
shot pitch-back.png
